a08147aac0" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289688 1145 "The denominator is $-2-3\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $-2+3\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-2+3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}} & =\\frac{4\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-2+3\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+12{\\text{i}}^{2}}{(-2)^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+12(-1)}{4-(-9)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-12-8\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{-12-8\\text{i}}{13}=(-\\frac{12}{13})+(-\\frac{8}{13})\\,\\text{i}\n$$" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289690 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289691 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1041 "field-1" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289690 13194139534464 true] [17592186289689 1110 #uuid "acc6a535-454a-5ae0-9bd1-6c9689bc94d5" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289690 1034 "-\\frac{12}{13}" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289690 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534464 true] [17592186289690 1111 #uuid "2fe10282-508d-5b3b-9908-a3fbb1809ad2" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289691 1034 "\\frac{12}{13}" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289691 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534464 true] [17592186289691 1111 #uuid "5890c373-95be-51c9-b36a-e328a1eba4d2" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289693 13194139534464 true] [17592186289692 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534464 true] [17592186289692 1041 "field-2" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289692 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289693 13194139534464 true] [17592186289692 1110 #uuid "9a14e7aa-438b-5c59-9476-9abd225220fe" 13194139534464 true] [17592186289693 1034 "-\\frac{8}{13}" 13194139534464 true] [1759